{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55183","headline":"掷瓦果悟道偈（题拟） · 智闲","name":"掷瓦果悟道偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一挃（一作「撃」）忘所知，更不自（一作「假」）修持（一作「治」）。\n[动容扬古路，不堕悄然机]（二句据《景德传灯录》卷十一补。\n）处处无踪迹，声色外威仪。\n十（《五灯会元》卷九作「诸」）方达道者，咸言上上机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}